WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.592 --> 00:00:04.233
"I don't understand," Roxy said.

2
00:00:05.013 --> 00:00:07.074
"I see a city, but nobody's here!"

3
00:00:07.094 --> 00:00:31.424
"Confused, you," Bippo Cozlin sighed.

4
00:00:31.444 --> 00:00:35.206
"There's a reason why the Hulzarians are experts in portal technology.

5
00:00:36.367 --> 00:00:37.888
They're afraid of everyone!

6
00:00:38.908 --> 00:00:42.150
They use their portals to escape whenever they're scared.

7
00:00:43.311 --> 00:00:45.232
They probably saw us coming."

8
00:00:47.133 --> 00:00:51.856
Voop! A portal opened, and an alien peeked out, looking nervous.

9
00:00:51.876 --> 00:00:55.618
"That's a Hulzarian," Cozlin said.

10
00:00:56.718 --> 00:00:57.899
She ran toward the portal.

11
00:00:57.919 --> 00:01:01.905
"Hey!" The portal swirled shut.

12
00:01:02.805 --> 00:01:03.806
Another portal opened.

13
00:01:04.246 --> 00:01:07.628
Voop! "Who are you?"

14
00:01:08.048 --> 00:01:08.989
a Hulzarian asked.

15
00:01:09.009 --> 00:01:11.110
"What do you want?"

16
00:01:11.130 --> 00:01:13.831
"Don't close that portal!"

17
00:01:14.191 --> 00:01:16.513
Cozlin shouted as she and Roxy ran toward it.

18
00:01:17.493 --> 00:01:19.054
The Hulzarian held up a device.

19
00:01:20.235 --> 00:01:22.216
Voop! A new portal opened.

20
00:01:22.756 --> 00:01:24.297
Roxy and Cozlin tumbled through.

21
00:01:28.939 --> 00:01:29.940
Roxy scratched her head.

22
00:01:31.112 --> 00:01:33.254
She and Cozlin were now facing a metal wall.

23
00:01:34.135 --> 00:01:35.216
She turned and gasped.

24
00:01:36.617 --> 00:01:39.079
They were in a room with one of Meltron's robots!

25
00:01:39.800 --> 00:01:40.701
They got ready to fight.

26
00:01:40.721 --> 00:01:43.443
"Wait, you."

27
00:01:44.704 --> 00:01:46.166
Bippo hopped onto the robot.

28
00:01:47.647 --> 00:01:50.189
He tapped its head, which made an empty clinking sound.

29
00:01:50.209 --> 00:01:52.531
"Disabled, him."

30
00:01:53.732 --> 00:01:55.494
Roxy took a closer look at the robot.

31
00:01:55.514 --> 00:01:57.496
"You're right, Bippo."

32
00:01:58.644 --> 00:02:01.626
Cozlin noticed thick metal bars on one end of the room.

33
00:02:03.808 --> 00:02:05.369
"We're in a prison cell."

34
00:02:05.389 --> 00:02:10.673
"Criminals, us," Bippo said.

35
00:02:10.693 --> 00:02:13.875
"We're not criminals," Roxy said.

36
00:02:13.895 --> 00:02:16.317
"This is a misunderstanding."

37
00:02:17.418 --> 00:02:19.099
A Hulzarian approached their cell.

38
00:02:20.940 --> 00:02:22.481
"Not criminals, huh?

39
00:02:23.882 --> 00:02:26.084
Then why did your robot attack us?"

40
00:02:27.360 --> 00:02:28.981
Cozlin looked at the broken robot.

41
00:02:29.001 --> 00:02:32.762
"That's not our robot," she said.

42
00:02:32.782 --> 00:02:35.904
"We're trying to fight those robots."

43
00:02:37.404 --> 00:02:38.985
The Hulzarian raised her eyebrow.

44
00:02:39.005 --> 00:02:42.326
"How do I know you're telling the truth?"

45
00:02:42.346 --> 00:02:45.728
"Easy," Cozlin said.

46
00:02:49.089 --> 00:02:51.330
Shloomp! She stepped through the bars.

47
00:02:51.350 --> 00:02:54.551
"We have super powers!

48
00:02:55.011 --> 00:02:58.354
If we wanted to attack, we wouldn't need that robot."

49
00:02:59.294 --> 00:03:00.696
The Hulzarian took a step back.

50
00:03:02.477 --> 00:03:03.298
Roxy sighed.

51
00:03:03.318 --> 00:03:07.081
"There are a lot more of those robots.

52
00:03:08.122 --> 00:03:09.743
And they've been taking over planets.

53
00:03:11.064 --> 00:03:12.185
We know how to stop them.

54
00:03:13.266 --> 00:03:16.109
But we need a portal to find someone to help us."

55
00:03:16.129 --> 00:03:20.492
"So it's true," the Hulzarian said.

56
00:03:20.512 --> 00:03:24.776
"We received reports of robots attacking other planets."

57
00:03:26.944 --> 00:03:28.464
She released Roxy from the cell.

58
00:03:32.346 --> 00:03:33.606
Then she held up a device.

59
00:03:33.626 --> 00:03:36.807
"I'm sending you to our portal makers."

60
00:03:41.268 --> 00:03:44.449
Voop! Suddenly Roxy and Cozlin were in a different room.

61
00:03:45.309 --> 00:03:47.030
A Hulzarian sat behind a desk.

62
00:03:48.670 --> 00:03:50.851
"Please describe the world you need to visit."

63
00:03:52.551 --> 00:03:54.032
Roxy quickly described the world.

64
00:03:54.976 --> 00:03:57.317
The Hulzarian nodded as he typed on a computer.

65
00:03:58.457 --> 00:03:59.558
Then he held up a device.

66
00:04:01.099 --> 00:04:07.021
Voop! Now Roxy and Cozlin were in a room filled with machines and other strange equipment.

67
00:04:08.441 --> 00:04:10.222
Several Hulzarians were busy working.

68
00:04:10.242 --> 00:04:15.084
"These portals are making me dizzy," Roxy said.

69
00:04:15.104 --> 00:04:17.605
"Couldn't we have just walked here?"

70
00:04:17.625 --> 00:04:19.966
A Hulzarian chuckled.

71
00:04:19.986 --> 00:04:22.667
"I'm Flix, and no.

72
00:04:22.927 --> 00:04:24.288
You were just on our moon.

73
00:04:25.588 --> 00:04:28.129
Now you're deep under the surface of Hulzar."

74
00:04:31.811 --> 00:04:32.832
He handed them a device.

75
00:04:32.852 --> 00:04:35.594
"This is your portal projector.

76
00:04:36.474 --> 00:04:37.655
Strap it to your wrist."

77
00:04:40.256 --> 00:04:41.657
Cozlin nodded and put it on.

78
00:04:41.677 --> 00:04:46.339
"Just press the button to activate the portal," Flix said.

79
00:04:46.359 --> 00:04:51.902
"It will act as a doorway between the world you're going to and this laboratory.

80
00:04:52.303 --> 00:04:52.783
Good luck."

81
00:04:53.944 --> 00:04:56.558
"Thanks!" Cozlin pressed the button.

82
00:04:57.720 --> 00:04:59.463
Voop! A portal opened.

83
00:05:00.985 --> 00:05:02.448
Roxy and Cozlin jumped in.
